WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.533
You press play on movie night.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:04.033
Then comes a scene you'd

00:00:04.033 --> 00:00:05.833
rather your kids didn't see.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.467
Meet VibeVideo AI.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:10.400
It's VibePlayer, with an AI that

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.533
finds those scenes for you.

00:00:13.167 --> 00:00:15.167
Open a movie, and it starts looking

00:00:15.167 --> 00:00:16.767
right on your own PC,

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.767
at two frames for every second of film.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.533
On my laptop's NPU, it reads a full-HD

00:00:23.533 --> 00:00:26.733
film about 17 times faster than you watch it,

00:00:26.733 --> 00:00:29.167
so it stays far ahead of you.

00:00:29.533 --> 00:00:30.967
Scenes with nudity,

00:00:30.967 --> 00:00:34.133
sex or kissing turn pink on the timeline.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.467
When playback gets there,

00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:37.333
it jumps right over them.

00:00:38.633 --> 00:00:40.300
You choose what to skip and

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:41.967
how strict it should be.

00:00:41.967 --> 00:00:44.300
And every scene is yours to change:

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.567
stretch it, trim it, keep it,

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:48.433
or add one it missed.

00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.733
Nothing is uploaded,

00:00:50.733 --> 00:00:53.467
and the file itself is never changed.

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:55.967
It uses your NPU if you have one,

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:59.033
then your graphics card, then your CPU.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:02.367
It's an early preview, so it can miss a scene,

00:01:02.367 --> 00:01:04.067
or mark a harmless one.

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:06.000
You stay in control.

00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.533
VibeVideo AI is free for

00:01:09.533 --> 00:01:11.900
Windows 10 and 11.

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:15.400
Download it at nomanshafiq.com/vibevideo-ai
